   {
    "label": "Outside",
    "w": 1056,
    "h": 816,
    "html": "<div style=\"width: 1056px; height: 816px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; color: #1B2440; background: #FFFEFB\">\n<div style=\"width: 352px; height: 816px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 40px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; border-right: 1px dashed #D3D0C6\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; color: #16306E\">Is embolization right for me?</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45\">You may be a candidate if you:</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4\">\n<li>Have had joint or lower back pain for 3 months or more</li>\n<li>Have arthritis or joint inflammation confirmed by X-ray or other imaging</li>\n<li>Haven't found relief with medication, physical therapy or injections</li>\n<li>Aren't ready for, can't have, or want to delay joint replacement</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 6px 0 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #C8231E\">It may not be right if you have</h3>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4\">\n<li>An active infection</li>\n<li>A cancer in or near the joint</li>\n<li>Severe arthritis better treated with joint replacement</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"assets/photo-exam.jpg\" alt=\"A physician examines an older woman's knee in a clinic exam room\" style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 120px; width: 296px; object-fit: cover; object-position: 55% 50%; border-radius: 10px; display: block\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; color: #4A5568\">Only your specialist can decide whether you're a candidate.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"width: 352px; height: 816px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 40px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; align-items: center; text-align: center; border-right: 1px dashed #D3D0C6\">\n<img src=\"assets/logo-long-nodivision.png\" alt=\"Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center logo\" style=\"width: 296px; height: 76px; object-fit: contain\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #16306E\">Call us to learn more or book a joint pain screening.</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 600\">{{STREET}}</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 600\">{{CITY_STATE_ZIP}}</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0\">Phone: 661-324-4100</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">Fax: 661-324-4600</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">heartandleg.com</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"width: 296px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid #E2DED4; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; text-align: left\">\n<img src=\"assets/qr-testimonial.png\" alt=\"QR code linking to a patient testimonial video\" style=\"width: 104px; height: 104px; flex: none; display: block\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C8231E\">Scan to watch</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.25; color: #16306E\">Hear a patient's story</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.35; color: #4A5568\">Individual results vary.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"map-slot\" style=\"width: 296px; flex: 1; min-height: 90px; border: 2px dashed #8A93A6; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 13px; color: #4A5568\">{{MAP}}</div>\n<div style=\"width: 296px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #16306E; color: #FFFEFB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px\">We check your insurance first</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: #D9E1F2\">We accept many plans, including Medicare. We verify your coverage and costs before your visit.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"width: 352px; height: 816px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #16306E; color: #FFFEFB; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"height: 12px; background: #C8231E\"></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 32px 28px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.05\">Do you have joint pain?</h1>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; color: #D9E1F2\">Discover a minimally invasive option for knee, hip, shoulder, hand, wrist, ankle, lower back and heel (plantar fasciitis) pain.</p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"assets/photo-hiking.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling older couple hiking a sunny trail with friends\" style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; width: 296px; margin: 0 28px; object-fit: cover; object-position: 62% 45%; border-radius: 10px; display: block\">\n<div style=\"margin: 20px 28px 28px; background: #FFFEFB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px\">\n<img src=\"assets/logo-tall-nodivision.png\" alt=\"Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center logo\" style=\"width: 190px; height: 166px; object-fit: contain\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #16306E\">{{LOCATION_NAME}}</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
   },
   {
    "label": "Inside",
    "w": 1056,
    "h": 816,
    "html": "<div style=\"width: 1056px; height: 816px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; color: #1B2440; background: #FFFEFB\">\n<div style=\"width: 352px; height: 816px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 40px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; border-right: 1px dashed #D3D0C6\">\n<div style=\"height: 8px; width: 64px; background: #C8231E; border-radius: 4px\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.15; color: #16306E\">A less invasive option for joint pain</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5\">Osteoarthritis is a progressive disease. Over time, chronic inflammation causes pain and can speed the breakdown of cartilage inside the joint.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5\">For mild to moderate pain, doctors often recommend medication, physical therapy, or gel or steroid injections. Joint replacement is the standard treatment for severe arthritis.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5\">But not everyone is able, or ready, to have surgery, and a lifetime of pain medication isn't right for everyone either.</p>\n<img src=\"assets/photo-shoulder.jpg\" alt=\"An older man holds his sore shoulder\" style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 130px; width: 296px; object-fit: cover; object-position: 35% 40%; border-radius: 10px; display: block\">\n<div style=\"background: #C8231E; color: #FFFEFB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.35\">Today there's another option to ask about: joint embolization.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"width: 352px; height: 816px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 40px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; border-right: 1px dashed #D3D0C6\">\n<img src=\"assets/illustration-joints.jpg\" alt=\"Illustration comparing a healthy joint with an inflamed, arthritic joint\" style=\"height: 150px; width: 296px; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 35%; border-radius: 10px; display: block; background: #F4F4F2\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.15; color: #16306E\">How embolization works</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5\">Embolization is a minimally invasive, outpatient procedure. A specialist places a thin catheter into an artery in your upper thigh or wrist, then uses X-ray imaging to guide it to the small arteries feeding the inflamed lining of the joint.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5\">Tiny particles are released to reduce blood flow to the inflamed tissue. The goal is to calm inflammation and ease pain.</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; background: #F7F6F2; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; color: #16306E\">Areas we treat</p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 600\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">Knee (GAE)</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">Hip</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">Shoulder</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">Hand</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">Wrist</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">Ankle</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">Lower back</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">Heel pain</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; color: #4A5568\">Results vary. Research is ongoing, and like any procedure it has risks. Your specialist will explain benefits, risks and alternatives.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"width: 352px; height: 816px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"padding: 40px 28px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; color: #16306E\">What causes osteoarthritis?</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5\">Cartilage cushions the ends of your bones so joints move smoothly. As it wears down, bones rub together, causing inflammation, pain, stiffness and swelling.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5\">Common risk factors include:</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4\">\n<li>Age and family history</li>\n<li>Carrying extra weight</li>\n<li>An old joint injury</li>\n<li>Work or sports that stress the joint</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; margin: 0 20px 24px; background: #16306E; color: #FFFEFB; border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; border-top: 6px solid #C8231E\">\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px\">Talk to your doctor about embolization</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #D9E1F2\">If surgery isn't right for you, or you'd rather wait, share this brochure with your doctor or call us directly to make an informed decision.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 20px\">661-324-4100</p>\n<div style=\"flex: 1\"></div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #3A5291; padding-top: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px\">\n<img src=\"assets/dr-kumar.jpg\" alt=\"Dr. Vinod Kumar\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 3px solid #FFFEFB; flex: none\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2A7A3\">Meet your specialist</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.15\">Dr. Vinod Kumar</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #D9E1F2\">Interventional cardiovascular specialist, 30+ years</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #D9E1F2\">\n\n\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
   }
